":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-03T05:17:33-07:00","id":1333809,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s odd then that I don\u2019t recall ever seeing a path skill referred to as an asset skill except for the 2 pantheon path skills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-03T05:33:20-07:00","id":1333812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1333567-asset-skills?p=1333631#post1333631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a few things, though they don't always make sure to specify the word &amp;quot;asset.&amp;quot; Invoking a Twist of Fate applies to a Path Asset Skill roll, but the Twist of Fate section just says Path Skills.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can\u2019t actually find anything in the book that restricts Twist of Fate to path skills. It doesn\u2019t even imply it anywhere. Quite the opposite\u2014it says any plausibly related skill roll.","signature":"","edited":{"use